{"type":"text","timestamp":1788172671881,"sessionID":"ses_fa89af6b3ffeNJjfALu1dal10Z","part":{"id":"prt_057659713001mQmzLWn5iiypYv","messageID":"msg_0576572c4001mSemERMDaGMfDX","sessionID":"ses_fa89af6b3ffeNJjfALu1dal10Z","type":"text","text":"The implementation confirms the production bug: it ignores both injected sources, calls wall-clock time multiple times, and shuffles ready tasks before sorting. I’ll replace those paths with one clock read per operation, injected jitter, and an explicit stable ordering key (priority, creation time, task ID).","time":{"start":1788172670739,"end":1788172671871},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0bd3c9711adf3adb016a95597eab7887d2b67104a8b1dc5dd8","phase":"commentary"}}}}
