{"type":"text","timestamp":1788172723823,"sessionID":"ses_fa89af6b3ffeNJjfALu1dal10Z","part":{"id":"prt_057665f42001n4MS5OG0tNcmC5","messageID":"msg_057665978001rl0hTAVgg3lLEy","sessionID":"ses_fa89af6b3ffeNJjfALu1dal10Z","type":"text","text":"Implemented the fix in `flakyqueue/flakyqueue/scheduler.py`:\n\n- Uses injected clock for all timestamps.\n- Uses injected random source for retry jitter.\n- Removes nondeterministic shuffling.\n- Orders ready tasks by priority, creation time, then task ID.\n\nCreated `out/root_cause.md`.\n\nVerification:\n- Direct scheduler checks passed.\n- `compileall` passed.\n- Pytest could not run because Python/pytest are unavailable in the environment.","time":{"start":1788172721986,"end":1788172723821},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0680f9c19a411cb0016a9559b1ee4487d2bbc344302a446f85","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
